id=adb_tcp_persist
name=Persistent ADB over TCP (port 5555)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=zorrobyte
description=Keeps adbd listening on TCP 5555 across every reboot, so wireless adb (adb connect <ip>:5555) survives even when a USB-C->DP cable occupies the only port. Needed for external-display work on the Razr Fold 2026.
